  // Complete: every level and every exterior region (`HOUSE-00367`…`HOUSE-00372`).
  //
  // The remaining unset field is a forward reference, not an omission. Filling it here would
  // make this file the source of truth for a table another task owns:
  //
  //   daylight.windowIds                               a later daylight-window assignment
  //
  // `HOUSE-00908` assigns floor, wall, ceiling and trim materials to all 78 non-exterior cells.
  // Exterior floors retain `HOUSE-00385`'s assignments for the snow-shell build; exterior wall,
  // trim and roof assignment belongs to `HOUSE-00907` because those are shell surface classes,
  // not room palettes.
  //
  // `footstepSurface`, `acoustic`, `lightGroups`, `thermal` and `residencyPack` ARE authored: they are
  // properties of the room as experienced (§22.3) and nothing else declares them.
